# User Studies in the Humanities: A Survey and a Proposal

**Authors:** Bebout, Lois, And Others

## Abstract
A review of research on use of the library by workers in the humanities. Includes tables of citations and humanities journals studied and a generalized profile of information seeking behavior of scientists, social scientists, and humanists. (LS)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ124586

